    "collapsible_content_jUHcLx": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_HrkPVd": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How long will it take to see results?",
            "icon": "",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Most users notice improvements in freshness and overall balance within 1-2 weeks of consistent use, but some may experience benefits sooner.</p><p>For best results, take 2 gummies daily. Consistent use will help maintain your body’s natural pH balance and promote a fresher scent.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_RzcPEP": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I take it with other supplements?",
            "icon": "",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, these gummies are formulated to work alongside most other daily vitamins or supplements. Always consult with a healthcare professional if you have concerns.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_YK44t9": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Should I use these if I don't have odor issues?",
            "icon": "",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Yes! FloraFresh - Vaginal Probiotics Gummies can be used to maintain freshness and health, even if you don’t currently struggle with odor or imbalance.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_MryWi3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Are they vegan and gluten-free?",
            "icon": "",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, FloraFresh - Vaginal Probiotics Gummies are made with vegan, gluten-free, and non-GMO ingredients, so they’re perfect for a variety of dietary preferences!</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_q8RiGh": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Are there any side effects?",
            "icon": "",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Our FloraFresh - Vaginal Probiotics Gummies are formulated to work naturally with your body's own microbiome.</p><p>Unlike harsh treatments that can disrupt your flora, our heat-resistant strain gently colonizes and restores balance.</p><p>You won't experience the typical side effects of other products like burning, irritation, or increased dryness.</p><p><strong>Some key points women should know:</strong></p><ul><li>No disruption of natural pH (our gummies produce the exact same L-lactic acid your healthy bacteria make)</li><li>Won't cause yeast infections (unlike many other treatments)</li><li>No digestive issues (our strain is stomach-friendly)</li><li>No weird taste (the pineapple enzymes work naturally)</li></ul><p>Zero artificial ingredients or harsh chemicals</p><p>We recommend taking 2 gummies daily.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_G7XXhi": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can this product be used if pregnant?",
            "icon": "",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>If you're pregnant, it's essential to consult your doctor before using any new supplements, including FloraFresh - Vaginal Probiotics Gummies.</p><p>While the ingredients are 100% natural and safe, your doctor will provide personalized advice based on your specific health needs during pregnancy.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
